  "bodyHash": "3d0c8d09fd998a8a",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>探索</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">为游戏增添了更多原版风格的建筑</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组支持 Forge 和 Fabric（自 1.18.2 版本起）。请查看文件标签页以查看所有模组版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处获取</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前已添加的建筑：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>被遗忘的井</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>丛林神庙</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>神龛</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cLxYjbk/forgotten-well.png\" alt=\"forgotten well\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tY40Ttq/jungle-temple.png\" alt=\"jungle temple\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5xKMs5S/shrine.png\" alt=\"shrine\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>地下神庙</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0cKmPqp/underground-temple.png\" alt=\"underground temple\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3SLhq9h/underground-temple-2.png\" alt=\"underground temple\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3CfqXrz/underground-temple-3.png\" alt=\"underground temple\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>浮空岛</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>大型橡树</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>原木堆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LYMX3kg/floating-island.png\" alt=\"floating island\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9c8YJKD/large-oak-tree.png\" alt=\"large oak tree\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/chKJKLd/logs.png\" alt=\"logs\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>沙漠神殿</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\"><strong>史莱姆洞穴</strong></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wKZ2wnL/desert-ruin.gif\" alt=\"desert ruin\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/X8BWG6Z/slime-cave-raw-left.png\" alt=\"slime cave left\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YLssKsf/slime-cave-raw-right.png\" alt=\"slime cave right\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">官方数据包：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/no-more-floating-islands\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoMoreFloatingIslands</a> =&gt; 阻止浮空岛生成</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您对模组有任何疑问，或想了解即将推出的功能：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎加入我的&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a> </span></p>",
